      "items": [
        {
          "heading": "Surprised at the result",
          "reviewText": "So easy peasy to use! In just 5 minutes like shampoo I can apply and it leaves my hair so shiny and wonderful!! Totally recommended for people like me who can’t get roots touched up every other week! Thanks BBLUNT!",
