        },
        {
          "heading": "Last Longing Hair Colour!",
          "reviewText": "My friend suggested me use this hair colour, and I tried it. Guess what? I was shocked as it gives a smooth glossy & nourished finish, covers grey hairs, and looks natural. The colour easily lasted for more than two months, unlike other brands in the market.",
